t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-1-removebg-preview-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-2534\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>GIS-IDEAS 2026 will be hosted by HUMG at Hanoi, Vietnam between 24-27 September, 2026! GIS-IDEAS 2024 GENERAL TRACK e-Proceedings IS NOW AVAILABLE. CLICK HERE TO ACCESS IT!\u00a0 The International Conference on GeoInformatics for Spatial-Infrastructure Development in Earth &amp; Allied Sciences (GIS-IDEAS) provides a platform for sharing of knowledge and valuable experiences and help promote collaborations and scientific exchanges between not only between students, researchers and practitioners from Japan, Vietnam and Thailand but also our other colleagues involved in developing and promoting GeoInformatics technologies. The conduct of\u00a0GIS-IDEAS\u00a0Conferences is based on the spirit of mutual cooperation and openness.\u00a0GIS-IDEAS\u00a0is planned around a central theme which is decided in consultation with the host institution. Apart from Technical Sessions on GeoInformatics technologies and applications, Special sessions on different topics related to Geo-informatics are also held during the conference. GIS-IDEAS 2024 will focus on applications of GIS, Remote Sensing, GNSS-GPS, and Geoinformatics Education to address issues related to our natural, social, and human environment. GIS-IDEAS 2024 not only aims to serve as a forum for scientific exchanges but also as a conduit for technology transfer through workshop sessions. Language of the conference will be English. Our Keynote Speakers Dr. Pakorn Petchprayoon Bio Dr. Susumu Nonogaki Bio Dr. Tran Van Anh Bio Dr. Natraj Vaddadi Bio SPECIAL SESSION PROPOSAL AND PAPER SUBMISSION Prospective authors can submit their special session proposal and paper by following the guidelines on the conference webpage (https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/).<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-6","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"rttpg_featured_image_url":null,"rttpg_author":{"display_name":"admin","author_link":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/author\/admin\/"},"rttpg_comment":0,"rttpg_category":null,"rttpg_excerpt":"GIS-IDEAS 2026 will be hosted by HUMG at Hanoi, Vietnam between 24-27 September, 2026! GIS-IDEAS 2024 GENERAL TRACK e-Proceedings IS NOW AVAILABLE. CLICK HERE TO ACCESS IT!\u00a0 The International Conference on GeoInformatics for Spatial-Infrastructure Development in Earth &amp; Allied Sciences (GIS-IDEAS) provides a platform for sharing of knowledge and valuable experiences and help promote collaborations&hellip;","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6"}],"version-history":[{"count":614,"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2815,"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6\/revisions\/2815"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/gis-ideas.org\/2024\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}